Flipping coordinates can invalidate stored projections, so you should re‑establish projections after the operation.
```
// We start a SimpleDB instance
import { SimpleDB } from "@nshiab/simple-data-analysis";
const sdb = new SimpleDB();
// We create a new table
const table = sdb.newTable();
// Load geospatial data
await table.loadGeoData("./my-geodata.geojson");
// Flip coordinates in the default geometry column
await table.flipCoordinates();
// Re‑set the projection (example: EPSG:4326)
await table.setProjection("EPSG:4326");
