Pass an array of column names to the `on` option to consider those columns when identifying duplicates.

```
// We start a SimpleDB instance
import { SimpleDB } from "@nshiab/simple-data-analysis";
const sdb = new SimpleDB();
// We create a new table
const table = sdb.newTable();
await table.loadData("./contacts.csv");
// Remove duplicate rows based on 'firstName' and 'lastName'
await table.removeDuplicates({ on: ["firstName", "lastName"] });
await table.logTable();
await sdb.done();
```

